    "statement_en": "In one word:\nwhat is the last decision you made today?",
    "lead_en": "One word only — no explanation.",
    "i_en": "Go quickly round the circle. You will hear small decisions: breakfast, the route, the seat. That is the point — deciding is something they do dozens of times a day; the session is about doing it together.",
    "off_en": "If the projector fails, write the question on the board.",
    "s_en": "If a student names a decision that concerns you, do not stop in front of the group — follow up privately under the school’s safeguarding policy."
